      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AUTUMN GLOW (5) first loss of her career came when third to Sir Delius in the Queen Elizabeth over 2000m here in the autumn. Returned with two effortless victories in the G1 Winx Stakes (1400m) and G2 Seven Sunrise Stakes over 1600m here. Undefeated at the trip and on rain-affected going. Stalks the speed and is the one to beat again. CEOLWULF (1) won this race last year and appears to be going just as well after his unlucky second in the G1 Epsom Handicap over this course and distance. Gets the right set-up and can really test favourite. MILITARIZE (4) backs up for the third week in succession after running sixth in the G2 Hill Stakes at Rosehill over 1900m last Saturday. Conditions suit and goes into the exotics. JUST FOLK (3) is holding form and can give a bit of cheek on his preferred race surface.",
